{
 "format": 1,
 "version": "1.9.1",
 "min_shell": 1,
 "notes": [
  "A Select button at the top of your notes: tap it, tick notes, then Delete, Move, Pin or Archive them all at once. Deleted notes go to the Trash with an Undo.",
  "Gemini is the default for everything: chats and the note-taker's notes. It's free. Want Claude too? Settings > AI > \"Use Claude too\" (and \"Write notes with Claude\" if you want Claude to write the notes).",
  "Gemini answers faster: each device learns which Gemini model answers quickest for you and asks that one first.",
  "Settings > AI > Check Gemini now also shows your connection to Google and every Gemini model your free key can use.",
  "Sent something to your PC or Chromebook? It's copied for you, ready to paste, with a little card showing what came."
 ],
